{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pulls/22","id":4795068957,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTxnIY88AAAABHc7yHQ","html_url":"https://github.com/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pull/22","diff_url":"https://github.com/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pull/22.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pull/22.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/issues/22","number":22,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Retornar à main a correção validada da entrega 1.8.0","user":{"login":"israelhudson","id":18661493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjYxNDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18661493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson","html_url":"https://github.com/israelhudson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## O que muda para quem usa\n\nA tela principal passa a mostrar “Laboratório de entregas”. O botão de tema claro/escuro continua manual e a preferência reinicia ao abrir novamente o app.\n\n## Por que integrar à main\n\nA correção da RC1 recusada entrou por PR #20 em release/1.8.0. Este PR retorna a mesma correção à main, para que as próximas entregas também recebam o ajuste. A RC2 usa o commit c8d8f337ee390755bcff795d558f8c6f6f19c35b; o retorno não move nem apaga tags.\n\n## Validação e momento do merge\n\nO PR #20 passou no check obrigatório com Flutter analyze, testes Flutter e 404 testes da esteira. Este PR executa um novo check da combinação com a main. O merge fica para depois de confirmar a promoção da RC2, com review da conta elegível e o check obrigatório verde.\n\nEnsaio de laboratório autorizado por Israel. A promoção registra uma tag estável e uma Release reais no GitHub; nenhum app ou patch mobile é distribuído.\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T02:11:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:11:23Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e2dbd1687b69216b9cc24f39eea761b1ee2ea6cb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pulls/22/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pulls/22/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/issues/22/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/israelhudson/flutter_code_push_example/statuses/c8d8f337ee390755bcff795d558f8c6f6f19c35b","head":{"label":"israelhudson:release/1.8.0","ref":"release/1.8.0","sha":"c8d8f337ee390755bcff795d558f8c6f6f19c35b","user":{"login":"israelhudson","id":18661493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjYxNDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18661493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson","html_url":"https://github.com/israelhudson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/israelhudson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u